{"model": "small.en-greedy", "slug": "C_S03E08", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "Why did I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 7.0, "text": "So I can keep my job and get busy with my education."}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 9.0, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 12.0, "text": "Because Greendale's a slam dunk."}, {"start": 12.0, "end": 14.0, "text": "So why should you?"}, {"start": 14.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "Why should you?"}, {"start": 15.0, "end": 16.0, "text": "Why should you go Greendale?"}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 17.0, "text": "That's easy."}, {"start": 17.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "Greendale has the most advanced typing class in the Southwestern Greendale area."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 23.0, "text": "And now you can register by fax."}, {"start": 23.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "Go Greendale, go Greendale, go!"}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "That, as you probably know, is the best way to get to the Southwestern Greendale area."}, {"start": 29.0, "end": 31.34, "text": "is the currently running commercial for our school."}, {"start": 31.34, "end": 33.54, "text": "Yeah, I always see it during late-night marathons"}, {"start": 33.54, "end": 34.64, "text": "of Fantasy Island."}, {"start": 34.64, "end": 35.94, "text": "That's not an accident."}, {"start": 35.94, "end": 37.64, "text": "It's the result of intensive targeting."}, {"start": 37.64, "end": 40.98, "text": "But now, Greendale's school board has given me a budget"}, {"start": 40.98, "end": 44.48, "text": "of $2,000 to update our little ad."}, {"start": 44.48, "end": 45.98, "text": "Are you sure it should change?"}, {"start": 45.98, "end": 47.36, "text": "I chose Greendale over City College"}, {"start": 47.36, "end": 49.86, "text": "because of the way that one dude goes."}, {"start": 49.86, "end": 51.52, "text": "[ Laughs ]"}, {"start": 51.52, "end": 54.1, "text": "You know I love to be seen agreeing with you, Troy."}, {"start": 54.1, "end": 57.16, "text": "But this is our chance to make Greendale's most reasonable"}, {"start": 57.16, "end": 58.36, "text": "dreams come true."}, {"start": 58.36, "end": 61.36, "text": "and I need your help, all of you."}, {"start": 62.36, "end": 65.36, "text": "That's okay, Jeffrey. You can say no."}, {"start": 65.36, "end": 68.36, "text": "This school asks very little of its students. It mainly gives."}, {"start": 68.36, "end": 71.36, "text": "I feel like you guys might know what I'm talking about."}, {"start": 73.36, "end": 75.36, "text": "How can we help?"}, {"start": 75.36, "end": 77.36, "text": "Oh, thanks for asking."}, {"start": 77.36, "end": 79.36, "text": "I've chosen you, Greendale's brightest,"}, {"start": 79.36, "end": 81.36, "text": "most coincidentally diverse,"}, {"start": 81.36, "end": 83.36, "text": "Hispanic's not-withstanding study group,"}, {"start": 83.36, "end": 85.36, "text": "to star in our commercial."}, {"start": 85.36, "end": 87.36, "text": "Pick a character we start this weekend."}, {"start": 87.36, "end": 88.86, "text": "-Oh, look, it's you and me on TV."}, {"start": 88.86, "end": 90.36, "text": "-Yeah, but if we're shooting this weekend,"}, {"start": 90.36, "end": 91.66, "text": "why are these cameras here?"}, {"start": 91.66, "end": 95.24, "text": "-Abed, true to form, has decided to do the weird thing"}, {"start": 95.24, "end": 97.74, "text": "and film a documentary instead of helping."}, {"start": 97.74, "end": 99.24, "text": "-As a student of character, I have a feeling"}, {"start": 99.24, "end": 100.24, "text": "that trying to make this commercial"}, {"start": 100.24, "end": 101.74, "text": "may cause the Dean of sanity."}, {"start": 101.74, "end": 104.08, "text": "And my camera follows the fire, not the smoke."}, {"start": 104.08, "end": 105.44, "text": "Ever seen \"Hearts of Darkness\"?"}, {"start": 105.44, "end": 106.94, "text": "Way better than \"Apocalypse Now.\""}, {"start": 106.94, "end": 107.94, "text": "-What's the catering you said"},