64, "text": "- It's Supervisor and I'm right behind you."}, {"start": 165.64, "end": 167.64, "text": "- Thank you, Supervisor Girl."}, {"start": 167.64, "end": 169.64, "text": "Faster than a locomotive."}, {"start": 169.64, "end": 171.64, "text": "- A script supervisor is the person that tells everyone"}, {"start": 171.64, "end": 173.64, "text": "to stay on script and keeps careful notes"}, {"start": 173.64, "end": 176.14, "text": "to prevent logical inconsistencies."}, {"start": 176.14, "end": 178.64, "text": "So basically the star."}, {"start": 178.64, "end": 181.14, "text": "- We open on a typical day at Greendale,"}, {"start": 181.14, "end": 182.64, "text": "only the students all look happy"}, {"start": 182.64, "end": 184.14, "text": "and you can't smell that smell."}, {"start": 184.14, "end": 185.14, "text": "Troy."}, {"start": 185.14, "end": 187.14, "text": "- Why do I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 187.14, "end": 188.64, "text": "- With three kids at home, you better believe"}, {"start": 188.64, "end": 190.14, "text": "every penny counts."}, {"start": 190.14, "end": 191.64, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 191.64, "end": 193.64, "text": "- And then you and Troy hug?"}, {"start": 193.64, "end": 195.14, "text": "If you're comfortable with that."}, {"start": 195.14, "end": 196.14, "text": "- Of course."}, {"start": 196.14, "end": 197.14, "text": "- Yeah, Troy and our buds."}, {"start": 197.14, "end": 198.64, "text": "Best buds, air buds even."}, {"start": 198.64, "end": 200.64, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 200.64, "end": 203.14, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 203.14, "end": 204.94, "text": "So I'm feeling stupid."}, {"start": 204.94, "end": 208.64, "text": "And then the camera pans and enter Dean Pelton."}, {"start": 208.64, "end": 210.48, "text": "I got stuck with the role of the Dean."}, {"start": 210.48, "end": 213.24, "text": "So I'm gonna show him how much of a Dean I can be."}, {"start": 213.24, "end": 216.4, "text": "And I've got a feeling I won't make the cut."}, {"start": 216.4, "end": 219.08, "text": "Welcome to Dean Dale Community College, Dean."}, {"start": 219.08, "end": 220.62, "text": "I'm a silly goose."}, {"start": 220.62, "end": 222.34, "text": "Honk, honk."}, {"start": 222.34, "end": 223.42, "text": "Dean only do."}, {"start": 223.42, "end": 224.32, "text": "Look at me."}, {"start": 224.32, "end": 225.22, "text": "Stop."}, {"start": 225.22, "end": 226.38, "text": "This is my sister, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 226.38, "end": 228.62, "text": "Stop."}, {"start": 228.62, "end": 229.62, "text": "You've hit gold."}, {"start": 229.62, "end": 231.16, "text": "Save some for the screen."}, {"start": 231.16, "end": 232.06, "text": "All right, people."}, {"start": 232.06, "end": 234.06, "text": "Oh, and I don't think Pierce is coming back,"}, {"start": 234.06, "end": 236.06, "text": "and someone fill in as the pencil."}, {"start": 236.06, "end": 238.06, "text": "Pierce Hawthorne's screen of stage and star"}, {"start": 238.06, "end": 241.06, "text": "will not leave this trailer until he gets a trailer."}, {"start": 241.06, "end": 244.06, "text": "And then I'm not leaving that trailer until it's catering."}, {"start": 244.06, "end": 246.06, "text": "And I'm not eating the food until--"}, {"start": 246.06, "end": 248.06, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 248.06, "end": 250.06, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 250.06, "end": 252.06, "text": "Just because. Just Dean it."}, {"start": 252.06, "end": 254.06, "text": "Dean machine."}, {"start": 254.06, "end": 256.06, "text": "Got Dean? Got much, much got--"}, {"start": 256.06, "end": 257.06, "text": "And cut."}, {"start": 257.06, "end": 259.06, "text": "Oh, a star is born."}, {"start": 259.06, "end": 261.06, "text": "I suggested to the Dean that we shoot my scenes"}, {"start": 261.06, "end": 263.06, "text": "in front of the Louise Guzman statue"}, {"start": 263.06, "end": 265.06, "text": "because the dean has no legal right"}, {"start": 265.06, "end": 267.06, "text": "to broadcast Guzman's image,"}, {"start": 267.06, "end": 269.06, "text": "which means every shot will be unusable."}, {"start": 269.06, "end": 272.06, "text": "I even put a call into Guzman's lawyers to alert them."}, {"start": 272.06, "end": 275.06, "text": "I'm always willing to go the extra mile to avoid doing something."}, {"start": 275.06, "end": 276.06, "text": "Like sex with women."}, {"start": 276.06, "end": 278.06, "text": "Shut up, Leonard. You smell like mentholleptus."}, {"start": 278.06, "end": 280.06, "text": "What are you even doing here?"}, {"start": 280.06, "end": 282.06, "text": "I'm thinking about breaking into the TV game"}, {"start": 282.06, "end": 285.06, "text": "since it's apparently sticking around."}, {"start": 285.06, "end": 289.06, "text": "I want to wake up in 30 years and wonder, what if?"}, {"start": 289.06, "end": 293.5, "text": "Because this full-time mama ain't breaking the bank with your expensive tuition."}, {"start": 293.5, "end": 304.0, "text": "Okay, good. Cut. Shirley, the boys. Can you make it, um, I thought it would be more \"sssss.\" What's another word that means \"happy threatening\"?"}, {"start": 304.0, "end": 318.02, "text": "The word he's looking for is sassy. He better pray he don't find it. As soon as we get this shot, we are done. Your phone is ringing. Oh. Dean Dini. Dean Carlton? Hey, man. How you doing? It's Louie Guzman."}, {"start": 318.02, "end": 320.22, "text": "- Louie Guzman, I hear you're making a commercial"}, {"start": 320.22, "end": 321.76, "text": "for Green Down, and you need permission"}, {"start": 321.76, "end": 323.9, "text": "to use my face or something?"}, {"start": 323.9, "end": 325.22, "text": "- Well, I, um..."}, {"start": 326.7, "end": 329.2, "text": "- Well, why not use the real pen?"}, {"start": 329.2, "end": 330.04, "text": "- I'm sorry?"}, {"start": 330.04, "end": 332.0, "text": "- I'm saying, I love to be in your commercial."}, {"start": 332.0, "end": 333.2, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 333.2, "end": 334.7, "text": "- Wowie!"}, {"start": 334.7, "end": 337.88, "text": "A real big time celebrity wants to be in my commercial!"}, {"start": 339.88, "end": 341.78, "text": "- Wowie, a real big time celebrity"}, {"start": 341.78, "end": 343.58, "text": "wants to be in my commercial, come on down."}, {"start": 343.58, "end": 344.72, "text": "- Yeah, that's cool, but listen,"}, {"start": 344.72, "end": 346.58, "text": "I gotta finish this movie, so, you know,"}, {"start": 346.58, "end": 348.82, "text": "I can't call for a couple of weeks, all right?"}, {"start": 348.82, "end": 349.72, "text": "- That's too good, Mom."}, {"start": 349.72, "end": 350.74, "text": "Louise, thank you."}, {"start": 350.74, "end": 353.44, "text": "And can I just say, I loved you in,"}, {"start": 353.44, "end": 354.72, "text": "(snaps)"}, {"start": 354.72, "end": 355.56, "text": "in,"}, {"start": 360.98, "end": 361.92, "text": "IMDB."}, {"start": 363.38, "end": 364.38, "text": "- I'm so mad."}, {"start": 365.34, "end": 366.4, "text": "- That was tragic."}, {"start": 368.06, "end": 370.14, "text": "The students here mean well, they really do."}, {"start": 370.14, "end": 373.3, "text": "But what Greendale has always needed is a miracle."}, {"start": 373.3, "end": 374.14, "text": "This is it."}, {"start": 375.1, "end": 377.16, "text": "This is how I get to put Greendale on the map."}, {"start": 377.16, "end": 379.76, "text": "You know, I thought this commercial was gonna be okay."}, {"start": 379.76, "end": 380.84, "text": "Well, guess what?"}, {"start": 380.84, "end": 383.16, "text": "It just officially became great."}, {"start": 383.16, "end": 384.44, "text": "Let me give you a little rundown"}, {"start": 384.44, "end": 386.4, "text": "of this commercial's great elements."}, {"start": 386.4, "end": 389.1, "text": "Luis Guzman is in it."}, {"start": 393.36, "end": 395.26, "text": "I'm sorry, will you excuse me?"}, {"start": 395.26, "end": 397.88, "text": "Everyone gather around, quick announcement."}, {"start": 397.88, "end": 399.28, "text": "Come on around."}, {"start": 399.28, "end": 402.8, "text": "Everything that we shot so far is worthless."}, {"start": 402.8, "end": 405.16, "text": "I've thrown it out and we're starting over tomorrow morning."}, {"start": 405.24, "end": 406.04, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 406.12, "end": 410.32, "text": "Because Louise Guzman is in the commercial now."}, {"start": 410.4, "end": 412.8, "text": "-Oh, no. -So, yeah. For realsies."}, {"start": 412.88, "end": 416.08, "text": "Everyone, go home. I'm rewriting all of your parts."}, {"start": 416.16, "end": 417.16, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 417.88, "end": 419.4, "text": "Except for you, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 419.48, "end": 421.6, "text": "You have locked into something here."}, {"start": 421.68, "end": 424.04, "text": "And the only thing your character needs..."}, {"start": 425.32, "end": 426.52, "text": "is more screen time."}, {"start": 428.44, "end": 431.2, "text": "It's great that he got a celebrity, but why reshoot everything?"}, {"start": 431.28, "end": 435.04, "text": "Perfectionism, the dean's first step down a road that ends in self-destruction."}, {"start": 435.04, "end": 437.24, "text": "That sounds horrible."}, {"start": 437.24, "end": 439.08, "text": "Actually, I might end up taking this to some festivals."}, {"start": 447.4, "end": 449.92, "text": "The dean's production has taken over the entire school."}, {"start": 449.92, "end": 451.04, "text": "Classes are shut down."}, {"start": 451.04, "end": 453.0, "text": "The quilting club is being forced to sew costumes."}, {"start": 453.0, "end": 457.6, "text": "Two females, both 5'10\", one brunette, one with asthma."}, {"start": 457.6, "end": 459.88, "text": "He's also using the PA system for casting calls."}, {"start": 459.88, "end": 461.48, "text": "OK, everyone."}, {"start": 461.48, "end": 463.32, "text": "Does everyone have their new script?"}, {"start": 463.32, "end": 465.88, "text": "It says I'm supposed to be a book, reading a book."}, {"start": 465.88, "end": 467.2, "text": "That doesn't make sense."}, {"start": 467.2, "end": 468.12, "text": "[CLEARS THROAT]"}, {"start": 473.08, "end": 474.16, "text": "What's this?"}, {"start": 474.16, "end": 476.2, "text": "Scene four."}, {"start": 476.2, "end": 478.28, "text": "Last night, I had an epiphany."}, {"start": 478.28, "end": 480.36, "text": "I'm ready to step this mother up a notch."}, {"start": 480.36, "end": 482.08, "text": "This commercial is going to push every button,"}, {"start": 482.08, "end": 484.04, "text": "starting with the one that is so hot,"}, {"start": 484.04, "end": 485.88, "text": "it will sizzle your finger."}, {"start": 485.88, "end": 487.8, "text": "Race."}, {"start": 487.8, "end": 489.24, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 489.24, "end": 491.72, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 491.72, "end": 492.62, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 492.62, "end": 493.52, "text": "I'm coming in."}, {"start": 498.7, "end": 502.32, "text": "I am trying to pull a 400-year-old dagger out"}, {"start": 502.32, "end": 507.68, "text": "of this nation's heart, and you two are hugging."}, {"start": 507.68, "end": 509.96, "text": "I understand, but you--"}, {"start": 509.96, "end": 510.84, "text": "What did I do?"}, {"start": 510.84, "end": 511.74, "text": "You didn't."}, {"start": 511.74, "end": 513.04, "text": "Let's take it again."}, {"start": 513.04, "end": 516.48, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 516.48, "end": 517.72, "text": "Again."}, {"start": 517.72, "end": 520.16, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 520.16, "end": 522.84, "text": "I need more, more!"}, {"start": 522.84, "end": 523.64, "text": "Wrong!"}, {"start": 523.64, "end": 524.72, "text": "Fight the power."}, {"start": 524.72, "end": 526.04, "text": "Fight it with your hugs."}, {"start": 526.04, "end": 529.68, "text": "Tear down those walls."}, {"start": 529.68, "end": 531.42, "text": "Can you get this wrong one more time?"}, {"start": 531.42, "end": 533.6, "text": "I'm segregating the school."}, {"start": 533.6, "end": 535.96, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 535.96, "end": 539.48, "text": "You can't even do it when we're helping you."}, {"start": 539.48, "end": 540.4, "text": "Somebody help."}, {"start": 540.4, "end": 542.0, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 542.0, "end": 543.92, "text": "Stop saying I'm different!"}, {"start": 543.92, "end": 546.88, "text": "Dean, we've spent 12 hours on the scene."}, {"start": 546.88, "end": 548.88, "text": "Maybe it's time to move on to something else."}, {"start": 548.88, "end": 552.38, "text": "I'm in psych 101 and even I don't know what's happening."}, {"start": 552.38, "end": 554.88, "text": "The Dean is going insane and taking all of you with him."}, {"start": 554.88, "end": 557.38, "text": "If you know that, then do something."}, {"start": 557.38, "end": 559.88, "text": "I'm doing everything I can. I only have so many cameras."}, {"start": 564.38, "end": 567.88, "text": "I've spent an entire day in this thing for no reason."}, {"start": 567.88, "end": 569.88, "text": "What if the shoot drags on for another day?"}, {"start": 569.88, "end": 571.88, "text": "Or God forbid, two?"}, {"start": 574.38, "end": 575.88, "text": "And action and move."}, {"start": 575.88, "end": 577.96, "text": "This full-time mama ain't breaking the bed."}, {"start": 577.96, "end": 579.2, "text": "Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut."}, {"start": 579.2, "end": 582.0, "text": "Gary, you're not taking advantage of the motion capture"}, {"start": 582.0, "end": 582.9, "text": "technology."}, {"start": 582.9, "end": 584.04, "text": "You have to move."}, {"start": 584.04, "end": 585.36, "text": "I forgot what I am again."}, {"start": 585.36, "end": 586.76, "text": "Oh, for crying--"}, {"start": 586.76, "end": 588.82, "text": "you are a microscope."}, {"start": 588.82, "end": 590.28, "text": "No, that's a toilet."}, {"start": 590.28, "end": 592.84, "text": "No, that's clearly a frog who can't get out of a box."}, {"start": 592.84, "end": 594.84, "text": "Jeff thinks he has it bad."}, {"start": 594.84, "end": 597.2, "text": "As Jeff's understudy, I have to wear my Jeff wig"}, {"start": 597.2, "end": 600.22, "text": "on top of my Chang hair, and then my ball cap on top of that."}, {"start": 600.22, "end": 601.96, "text": "There's no air getting through here."}, {"start": 601.96, "end": 603.76, "text": "I'm literally dying."}, {"start": 603.76, "end": 606.1, "text": "But you'll never hear my story."}, {"start": 606.1, "end": 609.1, "text": "I mean, now you heard it, but that was close."}, {"start": 609.1, "end": 611.06, "text": "Are you sure you can't work a little faster?"}, {"start": 611.06, "end": 612.64, "text": "Nobody asked for perfection."}, {"start": 612.64, "end": 614.5, "text": "Well, perfection is what you're getting."}, {"start": 614.5, "end": 617.1, "text": "And if you don't like it, you can fire it."}, {"start": 617.1, "end": 618.94, "text": "If we don't like it at this point,"}, {"start": 618.94, "end": 620.34, "text": "we definitely will fire you."}, {"start": 620.34, "end": 621.14, "text": "Good!"}, {"start": 621.14, "end": 622.5, "text": "That's how I like it!"}, {"start": 622.5, "end": 624.06, "text": "Huh!"}, {"start": 624.06, "end": 625.6, "text": "I'm surrounded by assassins."}, {"start": 625.6, "end": 628.02, "text": "My own school's paper has turned on me."}, {"start": 628.02, "end": 630.98, "text": "But when this is all over, I'll have a commercial with Luis"}, {"start": 630.98, "end": 633.5, "text": "Guzman in it and all they'll have."}, {"start": 633.5, "end": 635.66, "text": "are their words and their fears"}, {"start": 635.66, "end": 637.58, "text": "and whatever embarrassing photos they can get"}, {"start": 637.58, "end": 639.02, "text": "from my two-faced mother."}, {"start": 640.74, "end": 642.28, "text": "Garrett, I've got two men in diapers here."}, {"start": 642.28, "end": 643.62, "text": "I know one of them is playing the dawn"}, {"start": 643.62, "end": 644.74, "text": "of a new era in education,"}, {"start": 644.74, "end": 645.94, "text": "but I've got nothing on the other one."}, {"start": 645.94, "end": 647.78, "text": "Oh, I'm just a guest of the Dean's."}, {"start": 648.7, "end": 650.86, "text": "Well, both of you go that way then."}, {"start": 650.86, "end": 652.74, "text": "The Dean had his seventh epiphany today,"}, {"start": 652.74, "end": 654.58, "text": "which has given me an epiphany of my own."}, {"start": 654.58, "end": 656.82, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 656.82, "end": 657.74, "text": "He has to be."}, {"start": 657.74, "end": 660.02, "text": "If he isn't, I've given almost two weeks of my life"}, {"start": 660.02, "end": 660.86, "text": "to an idiot."}, {"start": 660.86, "end": 661.9, "text": "That is unacceptable."}, {"start": 661.9, "end": 664.78, "text": "Therefore, the Dean is a genius,"}, {"start": 664.78, "end": 667.78, "text": "and I will die protecting his vision."}, {"start": 667.78, "end": 670.54, "text": "Are you by any chance familiar with Stockholm syndrome?"}, {"start": 670.54, "end": 671.9, "text": "Is it something that the Dean created?"}, {"start": 671.9, "end": 673.46, "text": "Because if not, I don't care."}, {"start": 673.46, "end": 675.86, "text": "We all want to go, but the Dean won't let us."}, {"start": 675.86, "end": 678.22, "text": "I think Pierce played this as smart as from the beginning."}, {"start": 678.22, "end": 679.98, "text": "He's probably at home watching \"Forensic Files\""}, {"start": 679.98, "end": 681.06, "text": "and eating cheesy popcorn."}, {"start": 686.54, "end": 688.78, "text": "Well, about time."}, {"start": 688.78, "end": 691.58, "text": "Hey, that's for Luis Guzman."}, {"start": 691.58, "end": 694.96, "text": "Well, when you get me my trailer, he can have it back."}, {"start": 694.96, "end": 697.66, "text": "And make it as nice as this one."}, {"start": 697.66, "end": 698.7, "text": "Hey, Dean."}, {"start": 698.7, "end": 700.06, "text": "Dean, hey, Dean."}, {"start": 700.06, "end": 701.98, "text": "Piersmas took me for the Dean today."}, {"start": 701.98, "end": 702.86, "text": "I want windows."}, {"start": 702.86, "end": 705.26, "text": "How did that make you feel?"}, {"start": 705.26, "end": 707.42, "text": "I've become a stranger to myself."}, {"start": 707.42, "end": 708.82, "text": "I'm bald now."}, {"start": 708.82, "end": 710.7, "text": "I've always been bald."}, {"start": 710.7, "end": 712.98, "text": "I'm really dreamt of having hair."}, {"start": 712.98, "end": 715.46, "text": "And now the bald man is awake."}, {"start": 715.46, "end": 717.34, "text": "Jeff?"}, {"start": 717.34, "end": 718.26, "text": "It's time."}, {"start": 721.58, "end": 724.98, "text": "Lights, camera, dean."}, {"start": 724.98, "end": 726.98, "text": "Action."}, {"start": 726.98, "end": 728.48, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 728.48, "end": 730.48, "text": "Just because."}, {"start": 730.48, "end": 732.48, "text": "Cut. Cut."}, {"start": 734.48, "end": 736.48, "text": "Lose the bald cap."}, {"start": 736.48, "end": 737.48, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 737.48, "end": 739.48, "text": "I don't like it. It's hokey. It's fake."}, {"start": 739.48, "end": 741.48, "text": "Take it off."}, {"start": 744.48, "end": 746.48, "text": "No."}, {"start": 748.48, "end": 750.48, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}, {"start": 751.58, "end": 755.58, "text": "I have worn this stupid thing for 12 days."}, {"start": 755.58, "end": 757.58, "text": "I have made bald friends."}, {"start": 757.58, "end": 759.58, "text": "Well, that's your mistake."}, {"start": 759.58, "end": 761.58, "text": "Because it's a lie. It's Hollywood crap."}, {"start": 761.58, "end": 763.58, "text": "And I won't allow it in my commercial."}, {"start": 763.58, "end": 765.58, "text": "You're not."}, {"start": 765.58, "end": 767.58, "text": "Oh, yes."}, {"start": 767.58, "end": 769.58, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 769.58, "end": 772.58, "text": "Well, then, you're wrong for the part!"}, {"start": 772.58, "end": 774.58, "text": "Understudy!"}, {"start": 779.58, "end": 784.58, "text": "That's it. That's reality."}, {"start": 784.58, "end": 789.58, "text": "Winger you're done, go home. Go home."}, {"start": 789.58, "end": 792.58, "text": "Okay, I don't know why, but this is the last straw."}, {"start": 792.58, "end": 798.58, "text": "As a licensed psychology major, I am declaring this production a violation of human rights."}, {"start": 798.58, "end": 801.58, "text": "You have made us prisoners of your insanity!"}, {"start": 801.58, "end": 802.58, "text": "Shut your face, Britta!"}, {"start": 802.58, "end": 807.58, "text": "If the Dean wants his role to be played by a Chinese man in a blonde whip..."}, {"start": 807.58, "end": 809.58, "text": "Oh, my God, you are insane."}, {"start": 809.58, "end": 812.58, "text": "All right, I'm sick and tired of hearing complaints"}, {"start": 812.58, "end": 814.58, "text": "that I'm forcing people to be here."}, {"start": 814.58, "end": 818.58, "text": "Anyone who doesn't want to help me can leave."}, {"start": 831.58, "end": 832.58, "text": "- I'll be-- - Stop."}, {"start": 832.58, "end": 834.58, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 834.58, "end": 836.58, "text": "Keep rolling."}, {"start": 837.58, "end": 844.58, "text": "Hello, hello, hello. Hello with me, Louis Guzman. Hello. Hi. Hi. Mr. Guzman. Dean/derivier."}, {"start": 867.58, "end": 869.58, "text": "- I'm director, Craig Pelton."}, {"start": 869.58, "end": 871.38, "text": "Sorry, I've been editing."}, {"start": 871.38, "end": 873.54, "text": "It's a little bit of a mess."}, {"start": 873.54, "end": 875.42, "text": "(bell ringing)"}, {"start": 875.42, "end": 876.92, "text": "- What the (beep) is that?"}, {"start": 876.92, "end": 878.08, "text": "- Oh, that's a possum."}, {"start": 878.08, "end": 879.38, "text": "Once you spend some time with them,"}, {"start": 879.38, "end": 882.72, "text": "you see they're just like big, gentle rats."}, {"start": 884.72, "end": 885.56, "text": "- Who the guy?"}, {"start": 885.56, "end": 886.56, "text": "- I'm no one."}, {"start": 886.56, "end": 887.4, "text": "- That's Abed."}, {"start": 887.4, "end": 889.26, "text": "It's a little bit odd."}, {"start": 889.26, "end": 891.06, "text": "Now, without further ado,"}, {"start": 891.06, "end": 894.86, "text": "here is the commercial you will be starring in."}, {"start": 894.86, "end": 897.86, "text": "♪ When the score near won ♪"}, {"start": 897.86, "end": 899.36, "text": "- Why do I go green now?"}, {"start": 899.36, "end": 901.94, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 901.94, "end": 904.28, "text": "(gun fires)"}, {"start": 905.7, "end": 908.62, "text": "(muffled screaming)"}, {"start": 912.12, "end": 914.38, "text": "- I gotta make a phone call."}, {"start": 914.38, "end": 917.12, "text": "I had to tell this dean I couldn't do his commercial."}, {"start": 917.12, "end": 919.76, "text": "He didn't take that too well either."}, {"start": 919.76, "end": 921.0, "text": "Y'all gotta help this dude."}, {"start": 921.0, "end": 922.3, "text": "I mean, I heard you his friends."}, {"start": 922.3, "end": 924.34, "text": "- I'm more of a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 924.34, "end": 926.84, "text": "- Why this would go-- - What?"}, {"start": 928.34, "end": 929.84, "text": "You won't be in my commercial,"}, {"start": 929.84, "end": 932.14, "text": "but you'll be in his stupid documentary."}, {"start": 932.14, "end": 933.64, "text": "All he does is follow people around."}, {"start": 933.64, "end": 935.64, "text": "- Yeah, but haven't you seen Hearts of Darkness?"}, {"start": 935.64, "end": 937.14, "text": "Way better than the-- - Shut the hell off"}, {"start": 937.14, "end": 939.64, "text": "of my canvas, you ungrateful backstabber."}, {"start": 939.64, "end": 941.14, "text": "I already got rid of your trailer."}, {"start": 941.14, "end": 942.14, "text": "- I had a trailer?"}, {"start": 943.14, "end": 944.44, "text": "Can anyone hear me?"}, {"start": 944.44, "end": 946.74, "text": "I will walk off this production."}, {"start": 946.74, "end": 947.64, "text": "I will quit."}, {"start": 948.64, "end": 949.44, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 949.44, "end": 951.44, "text": "I come here to shoot this commercial for Glenda."}, {"start": 951.44, "end": 952.94, "text": "That's what you have written in the script."}, {"start": 952.94, "end": 954.44, "text": "Oh, that script was terrible."}, {"start": 954.44, "end": 955.58, "text": "I thought it was pretty good."}, {"start": 955.58, "end": 957.14, "text": "Of course you think that."}, {"start": 957.14, "end": 958.14, "text": "You went here."}, {"start": 962.04, "end": 964.92, "text": "Oh, I get it."}, {"start": 964.92, "end": 967.66, "text": "You're worse than crazy."}, {"start": 967.66, "end": 969.26, "text": "You're a shame at your school."}, {"start": 969.26, "end": 972.42, "text": "And that statue of me out there, that's just wrong, man."}, {"start": 972.42, "end": 973.92, "text": "LeBron's adds 10 pounds."}, {"start": 973.92, "end": 975.3, "text": "It's not going to be perfect."}, {"start": 975.3, "end": 977.26, "text": "Screw you."}, {"start": 977.26, "end": 980.3, "text": "I'm just saying, don't worship the people leaving green."}, {"start": 980.3, "end": 982.54, "text": "Then worship the people that are here."}, {"start": 982.54, "end": 984.28, "text": "Friendship displays."}, {"start": 984.28, "end": 985.68, "text": "It changes people's lives."}, {"start": 985.68, "end": 987.48, "text": "Look, I love my time here."}, {"start": 987.48, "end": 989.26, "text": "I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 989.26, "end": 993.04, "text": "That's way before Boogie Nights, too."}, {"start": 993.04, "end": 994.88, "text": "This is a special school."}, {"start": 998.4, "end": 999.56, "text": "You don't deserve to be here."}, {"start": 1008.2, "end": 1009.48, "text": "Are you still filming, Abed?"}, {"start": 1009.48, "end": 1010.52, "text": "Yeah, but try not to address me."}, {"start": 1010.52, "end": 1011.24, "text": "I'm not really here."}, {"start": 1012.54, "end": 1014.54, "text": "Neither am I."}, {"start": 1014.54, "end": 1018.54, "text": "I don't think I can finish my commercial."}, {"start": 1018.54, "end": 1022.54, "text": "But I think I know how your documentary ends."}, {"start": 1022.54, "end": 1026.54, "text": "Hi, I'm Craig Pelton,"}, {"start": 1026.54, "end": 1029.54, "text": "Dean of Greendale Community College."}, {"start": 1029.54, "end": 1032.54, "text": "I have failed this school."}, {"start": 1032.54, "end": 1036.54, "text": "I have failed it because I thought I was better than Greendale."}, {"start": 1036.54, "end": 1038.54, "text": "See, I went to a university,"}, {"start": 1038.54, "end": 1044.54, "text": "See, I went to a university, so I thought it was my job to improve this place."}, {"start": 1044.54, "end": 1048.82, "text": "But it turns out that the only thing wrong with Greendale is that it's run by an insecure"}, {"start": 1048.82, "end": 1053.5, "text": "wreck who holds five dances and two talent shows a year because he's afraid that the"}, {"start": 1053.5, "end": 1057.02, "text": "school isn't good enough."}, {"start": 1057.02, "end": 1060.9, "text": "But Greendale is good enough because it accepts me for when I'm not."}, {"start": 1060.9, "end": 1064.62, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1064.62, "end": 1067.86, "text": "And I'm so sorry what I've done to it."}, {"start": 1067.86, "end": 1070.5, "text": "and I'm sorry what I've done to the ice cream machine."}, {"start": 1070.5, "end": 1073.18, "text": "(screaming)"}, {"start": 1073.18, "end": 1076.26, "text": "Please no one eat out of it until you clean the nozzles."}, {"start": 1077.78, "end": 1079.1, "text": "Janitor knows how."}, {"start": 1081.54, "end": 1082.66, "text": "- I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1084.1, "end": 1085.3, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1087.94, "end": 1089.74, "text": "- Gentlemen, what I'm about to show you"}, {"start": 1089.74, "end": 1091.94, "text": "is not the commercial you paid me to create."}, {"start": 1091.94, "end": 1093.34, "text": "What I am about to show you"}, {"start": 1093.34, "end": 1095.42, "text": "is a glimpse into my mind and soul."}, {"start": 1095.42, "end": 1097.26, "text": "Please hold your questions until the end."}, {"start": 1097.26, "end": 1098.96, "text": "I know you will have a lot of them,"}, {"start": 1098.96, "end": 1101.52, "text": "but I'll understand if you'd rather I just leave."}, {"start": 1106.68, "end": 1108.22, "text": "- Why do I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 1108.22, "end": 1110.16, "text": "- The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 1110.16, "end": 1112.06, "text": "- To meet different people."}, {"start": 1112.06, "end": 1113.14, "text": "- With three kids at home,"}, {"start": 1113.14, "end": 1115.18, "text": "you better believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 1115.18, "end": 1116.5, "text": "- I love my time."}, {"start": 1116.5, "end": 1118.2, "text": "I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 1118.2, "end": 1119.34, "text": "- So why should you?"}, {"start": 1119.34, "end": 1120.22, "text": "- Why should you?"}, {"start": 1120.22, "end": 1121.9, "text": "Why should you go to Greendale?"}, {"start": 1122.94, "end": 1126.34, "text": "- Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1127.26, "end": 1129.26, "text": "Go, Greendale, go, Greendale, go!"}, {"start": 1132.26, "end": 1133.14, "text": "It's good."}, {"start": 1133.14, "end": 1134.04, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 1134.04, "end": 1134.94, "text": "Better than good."}, {"start": 1134.94, "end": 1135.86, "text": "Good enough."}, {"start": 1135.86, "end": 1138.86, "text": "Is there any more of the crazy Chinese guy?"}, {"start": 1138.86, "end": 1139.78, "text": "He pops."}, {"start": 1139.78, "end": 1140.66, "text": "I'm confused."}, {"start": 1140.66, "end": 1141.62, "text": "That's not my commercial."}, {"start": 1141.62, "end": 1142.74, "text": "I didn't make that."}, {"start": 1142.74, "end": 1143.66, "text": "Yeah, yeah."}, {"start": 1143.66, "end": 1144.56, "text": "OK, Zemeckis."}, {"start": 1144.56, "end": 1145.78, "text": "It moved through you."}, {"start": 1145.78, "end": 1147.74, "text": "Anyway, congratulations."}, {"start": 1147.74, "end": 1150.46, "text": "That should last us another 16 years."}, {"start": 1150.46, "end": 1152.74, "text": "So what's next?"}, {"start": 1152.74, "end": 1153.94, "text": "Chumps rusty bucket?"}, {"start": 1153.94, "end": 1154.84, "text": "Quarter taps."}, {"start": 1157.26, "end": 1160.94, "text": "Did you do this?"}, {"start": 1160.94, "end": 1163.52, "text": "You did mostly. You got the footage you needed at the first day."}, {"start": 1163.52, "end": 1168.78, "text": "I added a little bit of my footage to fill in the gaps."}, {"start": 1168.78, "end": 1172.18, "text": "I thought you were a fly on the wall. Some flies are too awesome for the wall."}, {"start": 1172.18, "end": 1175.94, "text": "Documentarians are supposed to be objective to avoid having any effect on"}, {"start": 1175.94, "end": 1176.62, "text": "the story"}, {"start": 1176.62, "end": 1179.58, "text": "and yet we have more effect than anyone because we decide to tell it."}, {"start": 1179.58, "end": 1184.06, "text": "And we decide how it ends. Will your story be yet another sad one of yet another man"}, {"start": 1184.06, "end": 1187.16, "text": "who just wanted to be happy, or will your story acknowledge"}, {"start": 1187.16, "end": 1189.4, "text": "the very nature of stories and embrace the fact"}, {"start": 1189.4, "end": 1193.46, "text": "that sharing the sad ones can sometimes make them happy?"}, {"start": 1193.46, "end": 1197.66, "text": "Before you say anything, no, I've got nothing."}, {"start": 1197.66, "end": 1198.86, "text": "Can you just forgive me?"}, {"start": 1205.02, "end": 1207.54, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1207.54, "end": 1209.46, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 1209.46, "end": 1212.72, "text": "Because we've all been there, which is why we're all here."}, {"start": 1214.06, "end": 1216.48, "text": "(soft music)"}, {"start": 1218.4, "end": 1219.24, "text": "- Oh!"}, {"start": 1221.74, "end": 1223.08, "text": "- I'm a good dean."}, {"start": 1223.08, "end": 1223.92, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 1225.92, "end": 1230.08, "text": "- Can someone help me get a live possum out of my office?"}, {"start": 1230.08, "end": 1231.08, "text": "- I don't know how we can do that."}, {"start": 1231.08, "end": 1234.58, "text": "- It just keeps jumping and skittering."}, {"start": 1234.58, "end": 1238.88, "text": "You think you're prepared and it skitters again."}, {"start": 1238.88, "end": 1240.38, "text": "- Okay, scene's over."}, {"start": 1241.38, "end": 1242.38, "text": "[laughing]"}, {"start": 1248.38, "end": 1249.38, "text": "[music playing]"}, {"start": 1252.38, "end": 1254.38, "text": "We'll be ready for you in 20 minutes, Mr. Garland."}, {"start": 1254.38, "end": 1255.38, "text": "Frank."}, {"start": 1256.38, "end": 1258.38, "text": "Climate Star!"}, {"start": 1261.38, "end": 1263.38, "text": "Fight will not be mitigated!"}, {"start": 1268.38, "end": 1269.38, "text": "Okay, you know what?"}, {"start": 1269.38, "end": 1272.88, "text": "I'm not coming out of this trailer until I get a new trailer."}, {"start": 1275.88, "end": 1278.38, "text": "And get me a granola bar!"}]}